                  "code": "B2.2.1.1.4",
                  "text": "Explore own experiences to talk about performing artworks that reflect topical issues in other communities in Ghana",
                  "exemplar": "Learners are to:\n- discuss the topical issues (e.g. no rainfall, rising temperatures, flooding, domestic and bush fires, road safety, burglary) of concern in Ghana;\n- identify the causes of these topical issues (e.g. deforestation, poor waste disposal, unsafe driving, illegal mining);\n- brainstorm on how these topical issues can be reversed or prevented;\n- develop own ideas and concepts for composing and performing own music, dance and drama based on topical issues in other communities",
                  "resources": null,
                  "keyWords": null,
                  "coreCompetencies": "Digital literacy, Communication, Collaboration",
                  "assessment": null
